WEBVTT

NOTE
Descriptive captions for the NextRep demo film. The film has no audio; these
describe the action so the reps are usable without watching closely.

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.500
[Q2 6:41] White brings the ball to the top of the key.

2
00:00:03.500 --> 00:00:09.000
Swing pass out to #22 on the right wing. #5 seals in the post.

3
00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:13.000
Red #21 leaves the weak-side corner and digs down at the post.

4
00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:17.000
#22 forces the post entry into two defenders.

5
00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:22.000
The pass is deflected out of bounds.

6
00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:28.000
[Q2 6:12] White reverses the ball to the weak side.

7
00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:34.000
#22 catches on the left wing. Red #4 sprints out with high hands.

8
00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:39.000
#22 rises up and shoots over the closeout.

9
00:00:39.000 --> 00:00:44.000
The shot is long. Red collects the rebound and pushes out.

10
00:00:44.000 --> 00:00:48.000
[Q2 5:34] #22 steps into the passing lane for a live-ball steal.

11
00:00:48.000 --> 00:00:57.000
Three-on-two the other way. Both red defenders retreat to the rim.

12
00:00:57.000 --> 00:01:02.000
#22 drives all the way into both defenders.

13
00:01:02.000 --> 00:01:08.000
Charge called. White loses the possession.

14
00:01:08.000 --> 00:01:16.000
[Q3 9:02] #22 waves up #5 for a ball screen at the right slot.

15
00:01:16.000 --> 00:01:22.000
#22 comes off the screen. Red #4 trails, red #33 drops to the paint.

16
00:01:22.000 --> 00:01:28.000
#22 refuses the pocket and drives into the drop coverage.

17
00:01:28.000 --> 00:01:34.000
The shot is blocked at the rim.

18
00:01:34.000 --> 00:01:42.000
[Q3 8:20] Red swings the ball. White sets its half-court defense.

19
00:01:42.000 --> 00:01:47.000
Red #11 drives baseline. #22 is the low man in the weak-side corner.

20
00:01:47.000 --> 00:01:52.000
#22 stays attached to the corner shooter.

21
00:01:52.000 --> 00:01:58.000
Red #11 finishes uncontested at the rim.
